      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَيْهَانٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَائِهٌ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, and
